'''Jar Base''' is an [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] that appears in the [[Anniversary/11th Year#Part 2: Clash in Jar Caves|Part 2: Clash in Jar Caves]]. It was added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Jar Base
|image = E 669.png
|first appearance = [[Anniversary/11th Year#Part 2: Clash in Jar Caves|Part 2: Clash in Jar Caves]]
}}

==Enemy==
It does nothing despite its special treatment as an animated base, basically acting as a regular base that can be hurt by [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s.

